        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Clark McReynolds, Calvin Coolidge, Woodrow Wilson, Warren Harding, Herbert Hoover, Franklin Delano Roosevelt\n- Roles: Associate Justice of the U.S. Supreme Court, President of the United States\n\nFacts:\n- Calvin Coolidge was born on July 4, 1872, and died on January 5, 1933.\n- Calvin Coolidge was the 30th President of the United States from 1923 to 1929.\n- James Clark McReynolds served on the U.S. Supreme Court from October 12, 1914, until his retirement on January 31, 1941.\n- James Clark McReynolds served on the Court during the presidencies of Woodrow Wilson, Warren Harding, Calvin Coolidge, Herbert Hoover, and Franklin Delano Roosevelt.",
